    "en": {
      "trackName": "Viper maze",
      "description": "Viper Maze is a retro-inspired snake puzzle game built exclusively for smartwatches.\n\nSwipe to slither through tight corridors and rotate the digital crown to turn. Each of the 100 handcrafted levels is a compact puzzle designed for short, satisfying play sessions — perfect for your wrist.\n\nNo ads. No tracking. No distractions.\nJust you, the maze, and your instinct to survive.\n\nDesigned specifically for smartwatch play.",
      "releaseNotes": "Added support for multiple languages.",
